My favorite idea for an improvement to the game is to allow more 
characters than just the graphics characters to be changed.  CHET
suppplies some great fonts for playing nethack, and the best ones even
show potions which look like potions, spellbooks that look like books,
etc.  The only problem is that  these are normal text characters, so
sentences end with potions and scrolls instead of exclamation points and
question marks!  Any idea about the feasability?  Wouldn't this be a
simple extension of the the  GRAPHICS keyword?


